      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/odin/{size}/2572_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-01-23T18:16:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>My second ever game was austria-hungary, actually wasn't bad. Second time I played as Austria, Juggernaught popped up and I was history. Still looks like we have five (including meerkat). If we get one more, it sounds like Arenson9 would like to play!&nbsp; <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"> &nbsp;I may just create the game and whoever is interested can join.</p>",
