      "raw": "[quote=\"phantaskippy\"]\n\nAww, someone played Austria Hungary first game?\n\n[/quote]\n\nIs this in reference to me? I played Diplomacy many times growing up -- on the order of a few dozen, back in the days before there were Internet judges. Later, I got a copy of Diplomacy on my home computer and played against computer-only opponents hundreds of times. Diplomacy against computer-only opponents is very, very different than playing against other people, so I don&#39;t count this as playing Diplomacy, per se, but it did give me a much more extensive knowledge of the board and of a few tactics.\n\n&nbsp;\n\nI love Diplomacy. I just care more about my relationships with people and my time. Diplomacy is to long of a game for me to spend that much time with strnagers and too relationship-stressing to play with friends.\n",
